{"title":"Research","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Research","format":"html","editor":"visual"},"headingText":"Recent publications","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\nMy work intersects psychiatry, sociology, and genomics to understand mental health across the life course, which covers four key areas: \n\n:::::: research-box-grid\n::: research-box\n<p class=\"research-box-title\">\n\n**Social connection**\n\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"research-box-desc\">\n\n</p>\n:::\n\n::: research-box\n<p class=\"research-box-title\">\n\n**Depression risk and presentation**\n\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"research-box-desc\">\n\n</p>\n:::\n\n::: research-box\n<p class=\"research-box-title\">\n\n**Genetics and society**\n\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"research-box-desc\">\n\n</p>\n:::\n\n::: research-box\n<p class=\"research-box-title\">\n\n**Disparities in mental health**\n\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"research-box-desc\">\n\n</p>\n:::\n::::::\n\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\nCommitted to open and reproducible science: pre-registrations on [Open Science Framework](https://osf.io/r58nz/) and code on [GitHub](https://github.com/knthompson26).\n\n*Hover over an image for the paper title, or click through to read it.*\n\n### First Author {.pub-section-title}\n\n::: paper-row\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00127-026-03098-0\" title=\"Illuminating the complex interplay of risk factors for depression symptoms within a large-scale US longitudinal cohort (2026)\"> <img src=\"images/SPPE.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10519-026-10251-7\" title=\"Developing and Teaching Curriculum to Reduce Genetic Essentialism in College Classrooms (2026)\"> <img src=\"images/BG.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00787-024-02573-w\" title=\"The overlap between social isolation and mental health problems: a longitudinal behavioural genetic analysis in the E-Risk cohort (2025)\"> <img src=\"images/ECAP.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jaacop.2023.02.001\" title=\"Do children with attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder symptoms become socially isolated? (2023)\"> <img src=\"images/JAACAPO.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/jcv2.12073\" title=\"Trajectories of childhood social isolation in a nationally representative cohort (2022)\"> <img src=\"images/JCPPA.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/da.23213\" title=\"Age and sex-related variability in the presentation of generalized anxiety and depression symptoms (2021)\"> <img src=\"images/D&amp;A.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n:::\n\n### Senior Author {.pub-section-title}\n\n::: paper-row\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ssmph.2025.101886\" title=\"What Machine Learning Teaches Us About Depression Prediction Across the Life Course (2025)\"> <img src=\"images/SSM.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n:::\n\n### Collaborations {.pub-section-title}\n\n::: paper-row\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1017/S0954579426101758\" title=\"Bryan, B. et al. (2026) - Development and Psychopathology\"> <img src=\"images/DevPsych.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.xjmad.2026.100171\" title=\"Dunn, E. C. et al. (2026) - Journal of Mood and Anxiety Disorders\"> <img src=\"images/JMAD.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.xhgg.2025.100548\" title=\"Wedow, R. et al. (2026) - Human Genetics and Genomics Advances\"> <img src=\"images/HGG.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1017/S0033291725101037\" title=\"Skelton, M. et al. (2025) - Psychological Medicine\"> <img src=\"images/PsychMed.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jad.2025.04.010\" title=\"Morneau-Vaillancourt, G. et al. (2025) - Journal of Affective Disorders\"> <img src=\"images/JAD.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1037/dev0001788\" title=\"Thériault-Couture, F. et al. (2024) - Developmental Psychology\"> <img src=\"images/DevPsych2.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.socscimed.2024.116697\" title=\"Bryan, B. T. et al. (2024) - Social Science &amp; Medicine\"> <img src=\"images/SSMed.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1093/occmed/kqad138\" title=\"Bryan, B. T. et al. (2023) - Occupational Medicine\"> <img src=\"images/OccMed.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12888-023-04890-x\" title=\"Bright, S. J. et al. (2023) - BMC Psychiatry\"> <img src=\"images/BMCPsych.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12888-022-04275-6\" title=\"Rayner, C. et al. (2022) - BMC Psychiatry\"> <img src=\"images/BMCPsych2.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"http://doi.org/10.1017/S0033291722002501\" title=\"Young, K. S. et al. (2022) - Psychological Medicine\"> <img src=\"images/PsychMed2.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.janxdis.2021.102491\" title=\"Davies, M. R. et al. (2021) - Journal of Anxiety Disorders\"> <img src=\"images/JAnxD.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1136/thoraxjnl-2021-217487\" title=\"Holt, H. et al. (2021) - Thorax\"> <img src=\"images/Thorax.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jadr.2021.100201\" title=\"Peel, A. J. et al. (2021) - Journal of Affective Disorders Reports\"> <img src=\"images/JADR.png\" class=\"paper-img\"/> </a>\n:::\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\nMy work intersects psychiatry, sociology, and genomics to understand mental health across the life course, which covers four key areas: \n\n:::::: research-box-grid\n::: research-box\n<p class=\"research-box-title\">\n\n**Social connection**\n\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"research-box-desc\">\n\n</p>\n:::\n\n::: research-